Keep a shared levels as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared changed as 0.
For every spot from 0 to 17.
Place 0 into levels.

To relax from spot (a whole number).
The low is 100.
The row is spot divided by 6.
The column is spot modulo 6.
If row is more than 0 and item (spot minus 6) of levels is less than low, set low to item (spot minus 6) of levels.
If row is less than 2 and item (spot plus 6) of levels is less than low, set low to item (spot plus 6) of levels.
If column is more than 0 and item (spot minus 1) of levels is less than low, set low to item (spot minus 1) of levels.
If column is less than 5 and item (spot plus 1) of levels is less than low, set low to item (spot plus 1) of levels.
If item spot of heights is more than low, set low to item spot of heights.
If low is less than item spot of levels, set item spot of levels to low, set changed to 1.

For every spot from 0 to 17.
Set item spot of levels to 100.
The row is spot divided by 6.
The column is spot modulo 6.
If row is 0 or row is 2 or column is 0 or column is 5, set item spot of levels to item spot of heights.

Set changed to 1.
Repeat while changed is 1.
Set changed to 0.
For every spot from 0 to 17.
The row is spot divided by 6.
The column is spot modulo 6.
The edge is 0.
If row is 0 or row is 2 or column is 0 or column is 5, set edge to 1.
If edge is 0, relax from spot.

The total is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 17.
The extra is item spot of levels minus item spot of heights.
Add extra to total.

Show total.
